    "blurb": "Connect to SAP using RFC",
    "overview": "Integrate SAP into business processes using Remote Function Calls (RFC). This connector complies with SAP's Clean Core strategy, ensuring it's future-proof.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Orchestrate SAP tasks and data with the Camunda SAP RFC connector",
    "splashDescription": "Integrate SAP into Camunda-powered business processes with this SAP Certified hybrid connector, at no additional license cost for Camunda users. Camunda’s open, composable architecture enables you to orchestrate SAP tasks and data as part of end-to-end business processes, which improves process visibility, increases your business agility, and facilitates alignment between IT teams and business stakeholders. Add this connector to a process model in order to connect to any SAP system using Remote Function Calls (RFC). This connector complies with SAP's Clean Core strategy, ensuring your integration is future-proof.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/500380/overview/img1646882358326364972.png?faef805c573001a5aabfe91c8f2c2ec5",
